Jungtinių Amerikos Valstijų (JAV) prezidentas Donaldas Trumpas sekmadienį sureagavo į protestus, kurie savaitgalį nusiaubė Prancūziją.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Hundreds of thousands of people have taken to the streets across France in demonstrations against rising living costs and government policies. Violent clashes between protesters and riot police left vehicles burning, shops damaged, and nearly 1,800 people arrested. Journalists were also attacked during the unrest.
